gcc -fanalyzer -O2	warning	Src/TzParser.cpp	-Wanalyzer-malloc-leak	leak of 'fopen(filePath.std::__cxx11::basic_string<char>::_M_dataplus.std::__cxx11::basic_string<char>::_Alloc_hider::_M_p, "r")' [CWE-401]
